<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Andries Hendrik Potgieter</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">1792–1852</span></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Andries Hendrik Potgieter was a leader of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/great-trek">Great Trek</a> of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/boers">Boer</a> <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/voortrekkers">Voortrekkers</a> from the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/cape-colony">Cape Colony</a>. He fought the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/ndebele-kingdom">Ndebele</a> of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/mzilikazi">Mzilikazi</a> in 1836–1837, led settlers at Winburg, founded <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/potchefstroom">Potchefstroom</a> in 1838 and later moved to the far north, where he founded the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/soutpansberg">Zoutpansberg</a> settlement. He quarrelled with <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/andries-pretorius">Andries Pretorius</a> over the leadership of the trekkers north of the Vaal.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/andries-hendrik-potgieter.jpg" alt="Andries Hendrik Potgieter" width="250" height="305" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: Extracted by JMK, from upload by JohanWolfaardt · CC BY-SA 3.0 · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Andries_Hendrik_Potgieter,_Delagoabaai.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
